---
import PersonalImage from "../assets/compressed_cropped.jpg"
import Image from "astro/components/Image.astro"
---

<section id="about" class="px-6 py-28">
  <div class="mx-auto max-w-4xl bg-[#0f1a0f] border-1  border-[#33ff33]/20 px-8 py-4 ">
    <p class="mb-2 text-xs tracking-wider  text-[#1a7a1a]">$ cat about.txt</p>
    <h3 class="mb-10 text-2xl font-display text-glow md:text-3xl">ABOUT_ME</h3>
    <div class="grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-5 md:gap-8">
      <div class="md:col-span-2">
        <div class="aspect-square overflow-hidden border border-[#33ff33]/20 bg-[#0f1a0f]">
          <div class="flex h-full items-center justify-center font-display text-6xl text-[#33ff33]/30 md:text-7xl"><Image src={PersonalImage} alt="PM"></Image></div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="space-y-4 md:col-span-3">
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#33ff33]/80">
          <span class="text-[#1a7a1a]">[INFO]</span> I am an Engineer of Computer Science student at the University of Lodz (2022–2026) with hands-on Java and Spring Boot experience from personal projects and a fullstack internship at Esovisco S.P z.o.o.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#33ff33]/80">
          <span class="text-[#1a7a1a]">[INFO]</span> I build and deploy backend services with Java, Spring Boot, and Docker, and work with REST APIs, microservices, and frontend frameworks like React/NextJS. I have strong C++ skills proven by a low-level Game Boy emulator and multithreaded systems.
        </p>
        <p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-[#33ff33]/80">
          <span class="text-[#1a7a1a]">[INFO]</span> I enjoy tackling complex technical problems and I am eager to grow in microservices, Kubernetes, testing frameworks, and modern CI/CD workflows.
        </p>
        <div class="flex flex-wrap gap-8 pt-4">
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-glow">46+</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#1a7a1a]">GITHUB_REPOS</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-glow">1+</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#1a7a1a]">YEAR_INTERNSHIP</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-glow">8+</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#1a7a1a]">LANGUAGES_USED</p>
          </div>
          <div>
            <span class="font-display text-2xl text-glow">Native</span>
            <p class="text-xs text-[#1a7a1a]">POLISH & ENGLISH</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
